@startuml recommendation-service-피드백제출
!theme mono

title 추천·이력 서비스 - 피드백 제출 (UFR-REC-090)

participant "FeedbackController" as Controller
participant "FeedbackService" as FeedbackService
participant "FeedbackRepository" as FeedbackRepo
participant "MealRepository" as MealRepo
database "추천·이력 DB" as RecDB

== 피드백 제출 ==

Controller -> FeedbackService: submitFeedback(memberId, mealId, satisfaction, keyword)
activate FeedbackService

FeedbackService -> MealRepo: 식사 기록 소유자 검증
activate MealRepo
MealRepo -> RecDB: SELECT 식사 기록 WHERE mealId AND memberId
RecDB --> MealRepo: 식사 기록 반환
MealRepo --> FeedbackService: 소유자 확인 결과
deactivate MealRepo

alt 소유자 불일치
    FeedbackService --> Controller: ForbiddenException\n{code: MEAL_NOT_OWNED}

else 소유자 확인 완료

    FeedbackService -> FeedbackRepo: 기존 피드백 존재 여부 확인
    activate FeedbackRepo
    FeedbackRepo -> RecDB: SELECT 피드백 WHERE mealId
    RecDB --> FeedbackRepo: 조회 결과
    FeedbackRepo --> FeedbackService: 기존 피드백 여부
    deactivate FeedbackRepo

    alt 이미 피드백 제출됨 (수정으로 처리)
        FeedbackService -> FeedbackRepo: 피드백 수정
        activate FeedbackRepo
        FeedbackRepo -> RecDB: UPDATE 피드백\n{satisfaction, keyword, 수정 시각}
        RecDB --> FeedbackRepo: 수정 완료
        FeedbackRepo --> FeedbackService: 완료
        deactivate FeedbackRepo

    else 신규 피드백
        FeedbackService -> FeedbackRepo: 피드백 저장
        activate FeedbackRepo
        FeedbackRepo -> RecDB: INSERT 피드백\n{feedbackId, memberId, mealId, satisfaction, keyword, 제출 시각}
        RecDB --> FeedbackRepo: 생성된 feedbackId 반환
        FeedbackRepo --> FeedbackService: feedbackId 반환
        deactivate FeedbackRepo
    end

    FeedbackService -> FeedbackRepo: 누적 피드백 횟수 조회
    activate FeedbackRepo
    FeedbackRepo -> RecDB: SELECT COUNT 피드백 WHERE memberId
    RecDB --> FeedbackRepo: 누적 횟수 반환
    FeedbackRepo --> FeedbackService: 누적 피드백 횟수 반환
    deactivate FeedbackRepo

    FeedbackService --> Controller: FeedbackResult\n{message: "피드백 감사해요!", totalFeedbackCount: N, "내일 추천에 반영할게요"}
end

deactivate FeedbackService

== 피드백 스킵 시 기본값 처리 ==

Controller -> FeedbackService: submitDefaultFeedback(memberId, mealId)
activate FeedbackService

FeedbackService -> FeedbackRepo: 중립 피드백 저장
activate FeedbackRepo
FeedbackRepo -> RecDB: INSERT 피드백\n{feedbackId, memberId, mealId, satisfaction: NEUTRAL, skipped: true}
RecDB --> FeedbackRepo: 저장 완료
FeedbackRepo --> FeedbackService: 완료
deactivate FeedbackRepo

FeedbackService --> Controller: DefaultFeedbackResult\n{skipped: true}
deactivate FeedbackService

@enduml
